    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/12-02-lesson.md:5",
      "judgment": "buildscript先編譯為host程式、執行成功後才主要crate；build入口相對package根及Cargo慣用自動發現先教。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/12-02-lesson.md:21",
      "judgment": "env::var runtime Result<String,VarError>、NotPresent/NotUnicode含OsString、有限mode政策與CARGO_CFG_TARGET_OS來源先教；script的cfg!看host不混主要target。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/12-02-lesson.md:31",
      "judgment": "stdout逐行cargo::協定、rerun-if-changed/env-changed、rustc-env與error角色在build.rs前；先驗有限mode防止任意文字注入多行協定，error加unit return仍使Cargo失敗正確。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/12-02-lesson.md:54",
      "judgment": "env!編譯期static文字/缺值或非Unicode編譯錯誤，不runtime重新讀；固定TEACHING_MODE/target/host文字在library三函式給出，hostbool明說只存true/false文字。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/12-02-lesson.md:74",
      "judgment": "Bash NAME=value只該命令子行程的環境先教；demo→practice Cargo觸發重建，直接LESSON_MODE=demo成品仍practice的比較對source成立。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/12-02-lesson.md:113",
      "judgment": "option_env!為編譯期Option<&'static str>，缺值None非Unicode仍編譯錯誤；compiler/Cargo追蹤source環境macro變動，無需額外script讀取。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/12-02-lesson.md:132",
      "judgment": "OUT_DIR是script生成檔目的地且可能留前次輸出；build-dependencies host/normaldependencies主要crate分工足夠，本例皆不用。linker/兩個link協定僅明示後續路線，未偷需C/ABI實作。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/12-02-lesson.md:147",
      "judgment": "selected--test embedded只載已提供targets，Linux/Windows2tests、其他OS1；CARGO_PKG_NAME首用前教並在完整answer後才all-targets，因此無未教example API提前編譯。"
    }
